   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Two functions are defined by the equations <span data-math=\"f(x)=5−0.2x\">f(x)=5−0.2x</span> and <span data-math=\"g(x)=0.2(x+5)\">g(x)=0.2(x+5)</span>. <br> &nbsp; <br> <strong>Select two</strong> possible statements that are true about the functions.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(3)\">f(3)</span>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<span data-math=\"0\">0</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(3)\">f(3)</span>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<span data-math=\"5\">5</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"g(-1)=0.8\">g(-1)=0.8</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(0)=g(0)\">f(0)=g(0)</span></li>\n</ol>",
